DESCRIPTION:Mas Donkey\n\nStraight out of Lafayette\, Louisiana\, Mas Donke
 y brings a fresh dose of funk with a sound built for good times\, deep gro
 oves\, and moving the dance floor. Blending funk\, soul\, rock\, R&B\, and
  a healthy dose of musical unpredictability\, Mas Donkey delivers a style 
 that is equal parts funky\, playful\, and undeniably original.\n\nWith a g
 rowing catalog of original music\, Mas Donkey has developed a sound that m
 oves effortlessly between infectious rhythms\, soulful melodies\, catchy h
 ooks\, and offbeat musical creativity. Tracks like 'Fresh Bowl of Funk\,' 
 'GURL\,' and 'Baby\, Put Yo Phone Down' showcase an artist who isn't afrai
 d to have fun\, experiment with sounds\, and keep listeners guessing.\n\nR
 ooted in the musical spirit of Acadiana but drawing from a much wider worl
 d of funk and groove\, Mas Donkey brings personality and originality to ev
 ery performance.\n\nIf you like your music funky\, your grooves deep\, and
  your live shows full of surprises\, Mas Donkey is ready to funkify your n
 ight!\n\nhttps://events.timely.fun/kw4jncf1/event/78517091/20261218200000
